<title>USA: Coastal, Westcoast merge marketing.</title>
<headline>Coastal, Westcoast merge marketing.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp said Monday it has formed a joint venture with Westcoast Energy Inc combining both companies' unregulated natural gas and electricity marketing and energy management subsidiaries.</p>
<p>The new marketing company will operate as Engage Energy US LP in the United States and Engage Energy Canada LP in Canada.</p>
<p>The combined operation already has more than 2,000 customers and expects to post sales in its first year exceeding 7 billion cubic feet of natural gas per day and 20 million megawatt hours for the year. At such levels, Coastal said, revenues likely would exceed $4 billion.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
